gether to tidy each location, share equipment, and discover how much fun a simple task can be when it\u2019s done together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245210/extras/64a168ab7a24fdda10a00eac24ddcade.poster.avif?t=1759556642\" width=960 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245210/extras/64a168ab7a24fdda10a00eac24ddcade.webm?t=1759556642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245210/extras/64a168ab7a24fdda10a00eac24ddcade.mp4?t=1759556642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blow leaves alone or with a total of 6 friends online</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy levels full of leaves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgradable leaf blowers and unlockable equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op and offline single player</p></li></ul>","developers":["Alex Wittman"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245210/b12d1f058bb8c692ba1988cb0302ecbf59867160/header.jpg?t=1759556642","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2245210/896018518/9d7df8cf33a2fcb18175b4ea02329091461b95c8/1759555803/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759556641","dash_h264":"ht